VALUES ('8c6be148-918a-5f36-aff5-929b4c0a5b54', '9de0b789-1787-5b96-a373-a4a265607ffe', 'mcq'::public.question_type, 'mcq', 'Choose from the following the different kinds of page components you can create in APEX.', '["Interactive Grid", "Smart Filters", "Search Page", "Faceted Search", "All of them"]'::jsonb, '[4]'::jsonb, 'Technical Rationale: The correct answer is ''All of them''. In this scenario, ''All of them'' satisfies the architectural and operational requirements. Incorrect options (Interactive Grid, Smart Filters) do not provide this exact capability.
Key Takeaway: Remember ''All of them'' as the standard exam pattern for this topic.', 'Correct'::public.difficulty_level, medium, 1);
